<title>AUSTRIA: EVN tops up stake in Verbund.</title>
<headline>EVN tops up stake in Verbund.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian regional utility EVN Energie-Versorgung Niederoesterreich said on Monday it had increased its shareholding in national electricity grid Verbund to more than five percent.</p>
<p>EVN said the statement, required by Austrian law, had been filed with the Vienna bourse and Verbund, whose full name is Oesterreichische Elektrizitaetswirtschafts AG.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom +431 53112 274</p>
